url: "https://github.com/Neill-Erasmus/sugarcane-leaf-disease-detection"
abstract: "A computer vision system for detecting diseases in sugarcane leaves using deep learning. Implements and compares three models: baseline CNN, ResNet-50 with frozen weights, and ResNet-50 with fine-tuned weights. Achieves 98% accuracy with fine-tuned ResNet-50."
